OL,3,GNEWSACoastguard called to reported fall
OL,4,Aat Mow Cop Castle
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Coastguard helicopter has been sent
OL,7,Fto a National Trust site on the
OL,8,FCheshire-Staffordshire border following
OL,9,Freports that a person had fallen.
OL,11,FCrews at Mow Cop Castle included a
OL,12,Fsearch and rescue helicopter and
OL,13,FCoastguard rescue teams from Wirral,
OL,14,FSouthport and Crosby alongside an air
OL,15,Fambulance.
OL,17,FThe incident remains ongoing, the
OL,18,FCoastguard said.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
