OL,3,GNEWSACoastguard called to reported fall
OL,4,Aat Mow Cop Castle
OL,5,
OL,6,FMow Cop Castle is a folly, set at the
OL,7,Ftop of a hill with a rocky ridge
OL,8,Frunning along it, situated in between
OL,9,FCongleton and Kidsgrove.
